% First match: a row with "any" is the heading's "Other". The columns are
% the class of the outer sole, the class of the upper, the sport class (ski
% footwear, other sports footwear, none), plugs, an upper of straps across
% the instep, a metal toe-cap, and the height (below the ankle, the ankle,
% the knee).
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
